  "question": {
    "text": "The EAN of metal atoms in <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mtext>Fe</mtext><msub> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>CO</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msup> <mrow> <mtext>&nbsp;(NO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>+</mtext> </msup> <msub> <mtext>)</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is 'x' and EAN of metal atoms in <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>Co</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>(CO)</mtext></mrow> <mtext>8</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> is 'y'. The value of <math> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>y</mtext></mrow> </math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "72",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Oxidation state of iron in <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mtext>Fe</mtext><msub> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>CO</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mtext>NO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>+</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced><mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>x</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>2</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>0</mtext> </mfenced><mtext> </mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>2</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>0;</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>x</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>2</mtext></mrow> </math><br />So, EAN <math><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0057_b2bf4301d981.jpg\" style=\"width: 144px; height: 122px;\" /><br />Oxidation state of cobalt in <math><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>o</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>CO</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, EAN <math><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br />So, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math>"
